WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.502 --> 00:00:04.880
[man] You can never return
to Schmigadoon.

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:09.927
♪ Welcome to... ♪

00:00:09.927 --> 00:00:18.143
♪ Schmicago! ♪

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:21.855
- Oh, so we-- Oh. Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:00:25.192 --> 00:00:27.152
- Schmigadoon
was just the first act.

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:31.406
As the high of Schmigadoon
starts to wear off,

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:32.824
the realities of real life

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:33.867
start to set in.

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:36.411
- It occurs to Josh,

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:39.039
couldn't we maybe think about
going back to Schmigadoon?

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:41.041
- But what if we--
- Yes.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:47.005
This is not the kind
of musical I wanna be in!

00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:47.923
- Okay.

00:00:48.507 --> 00:00:49.842
- This world of Schmicago

00:00:49.842 --> 00:00:51.009
is a lot darker.

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:51.844
- Hello?

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:53.512
- Fans will be really shocked

00:00:53.512 --> 00:00:55.389
to see this era of musicals

00:00:55.389 --> 00:00:57.766
filled with mystery
and villains.

00:00:57.766 --> 00:00:59.893
- Allow me to introduce myself.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:01.478
- Our characters,

00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:04.106
we have darker histories,
darker origin stories.

00:01:04.106 --> 00:01:07.234
- Is that a--
a new meat grinder?

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:08.610
- Yup.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:10.237
- It's sexier, smokier,

00:01:10.237 --> 00:01:12.698
boozier, floozier.

00:01:12.698 --> 00:01:14.199
- Okay.
- I'm really into this.

00:01:14.199 --> 00:01:15.951
Yeah, ring it in, pal.

00:01:15.951 --> 00:01:19.121
- I was determined
to bring everybody back

00:01:19.121 --> 00:01:21.164
but as a different character,

00:01:21.164 --> 00:01:23.125
apart from Keegan and Cecily,
who are still Josh and Melissa.

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:24.376
- It's the mayor.
(laughs)

00:01:24.376 --> 00:01:25.836
Hey, Mr. Mayor!

00:01:25.836 --> 00:01:27.963
- I don't think
that's the mayor.

00:01:27.963 --> 00:01:29.256
- It's like we have
our little troupe

00:01:29.256 --> 00:01:30.591
of merry musical players,

00:01:30.591 --> 00:01:33.135
and we all get to play
new roles.

00:01:33.135 --> 00:01:36.263
- It's sinister,
sexually diverse,

00:01:36.263 --> 00:01:37.514
in a wonderful way.

00:01:39.183 --> 00:01:42.019
- The music and the lighting
and the production designer

00:01:42.019 --> 00:01:43.896
working so well together

00:01:43.896 --> 00:01:47.482
in such a beautiful
and mysterious way.

00:01:49.151 --> 00:01:51.069
- This season is gonna be nuts.

00:01:51.069 --> 00:01:51.904
- They're here.

00:01:51.904 --> 00:01:53.488
(exploding)

00:01:53.488 --> 00:01:55.073
- These musicals don't have
happy endings.

00:01:55.073 --> 00:01:55.908
(gun cocks)

00:01:55.908 --> 00:01:57.117
- I'll...

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.827
drink to that.

